<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Attestation {{numero}}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="attestation.css">
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: #FFF8F2;
      width: 297mm;
      height: 210mm;
      padding: 10mm;
      color: #1A1A1A;
      position: relative;
    }

    .attestation {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 4px solid #FF7900;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 15mm;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .bande-top {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 8mm;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF7900 0%, #E65100 100%);
    }
    .bande-bottom {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 8mm;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #E65100 0%, #FF7900 100%);
    }

    .watermark {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
      font-size: 120px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(255, 121, 0, 0.05);
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      white-space: nowrap;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #FFE0B2;
      padding-bottom: 8mm;
      margin-bottom: 10mm;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .logo-block { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5mm; }

    .logo-odc {
      width: 20mm; height: 20mm;
      background: #FF7900;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: #FFF;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    }

    .org-name {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .org-sub { font-size: 11px; color: #6B6B6B; margin-top: 2px; }

    .numero-block { text-align: right; }
    .numero-label {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #6B6B6B;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .numero-value {
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #FF7900;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .titre { text-align: center; margin: 8mm 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .titre-principal {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #FF7900;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .titre-sous {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #6B6B6B;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .corps {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5mm 15mm;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .intro { font-size: 13px; color: #6B6B6B; margin-bottom: 6mm; }

    .nom-participant {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1A1A1A;
      padding: 4mm 0;
      border-bottom: 2px dashed #FFE0B2;
      border-top: 2px dashed #FFE0B2;
      margin: 4mm 0;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 60%;
    }

    .formation-titre {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #E65100;
      margin: 6mm 0 3mm;
    }

    .details {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10mm;
      margin: 6mm 0;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .detail-item {
      background: #FFF8F2;
      border-left: 3px solid #FF7900;
      padding: 3mm 6mm;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #6B6B6B;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .detail-value {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1A1A1A;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .note-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #FF7900;
      color: #FFF;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 3mm 8mm;
      border-radius: 25px;
      margin: 4mm 0;
    }

    .mention {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 8mm;
      padding: 0 10mm;
    }

    .cachet {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 25mm;
      right: 45mm;
      width: 35mm;
      height: 35mm;
      border: 3px double #FF7900;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transform: rotate(-15deg);
      opacity: 0.85;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .cachet-inner {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 8px;
      color: #FF7900;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .footer {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20mm;
      left: 15mm;
      right: 15mm;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .signature-block { text-align: center; }
    .signature-line {
      width: 50mm;
      border-top: 1px solid #1A1A1A;
      margin-top: 15mm;
      padding-top: 2mm;
    }
    .signature-nom {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .signature-fonction { font-size: 9px; color: #6B6B6B; }

    .qr-block { text-align: center; }
    .qr-image {
      width: 30mm;
      height: 30mm;
      border: 2px solid #FFE0B2;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 2mm;
    }
    .qr-label { font-size: 8px; color: #6B6B6B; margin-top: 2mm; }

    .hash-footer {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 10mm;
      left: 15mm;
      right: 15mm;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 7px;
      color: #999;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="attestation">
    <div class="bande-top"></div>
    <div class="bande-bottom"></div>
    <div class="watermark">ODC CERTIFIED</div>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo-block">
        <div class="logo-odc">ODC</div>
        <div>
          <div class="org-name">{{odcName}}</div>
          <div class="org-sub">{{odcAdresse}} • {{odcWebsite}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="numero-block">
        <div class="numero-label">N° Attestation</div>
        <div class="numero-value">{{numero}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TITRE -->
    <div class="titre">
      <div class="titre-principal">Attestation</div>
      <div class="titre-sous">de réussite de formation</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CORPS -->
    <div class="corps">
      <div class="intro">Nous certifions que</div>

      <div class="nom-participant">
        {{participantPrenom}} {{uppercase participantNom}}
      </div>

      <div class="intro">a suivi avec succès la formation</div>

      <div class="formation-titre">« {{formationTitre}} »</div>

      <div class="details">
        <div class="detail-item">
          <div class="detail-label">Domaine</div>
          <div class="detail-value">{{formationDomaine}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-item">
          <div class="detail-label">Durée</div>
          <div class="detail-value">{{formationDuree}} heures</div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-item">
          <div class="detail-label">Période</div>
          <div class="detail-value">{{formatDate sessionDateDebut}} → {{formatDate sessionDateFin}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-item">
          <div class="detail-label">Assiduité</div>
          <div class="detail-value">{{tauxPresence}} %</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="note-badge">Note finale : {{note}} / 20</div>

      <div class="mention">
        Cette attestation est délivrée à l'issue de l'évaluation finale,
        sous la responsabilité de <strong>{{formateurNom}}</strong>, formateur
        de la session, et validée par la direction de l'ODC.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CACHET -->
    <div class="cachet">
      <div class="cachet-inner">
        ORANGE<br>DIGITAL<br>CENTER<br>★<br>OFFICIEL
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <div class="footer">
      <div class="signature-block">
        <div class="signature-line"></div>
        <div class="signature-nom">{{signataireNom}}</div>
        <div class="signature-fonction">{{signataireFonction}}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="qr-block">
        <img src="{{qrCodeDataUrl}}" alt="QR Code" class="qr-image"/>
        <div class="qr-label">Vérifier l'authenticité</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hash-footer">
      Hash : {{hash}} • Émis le {{formatDate dateEmission}}
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>